1
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:03,900
各就各位 准备开赛
On your mark, get ready to race

2
00:00:04,165 --> 00:00:06,875
一 二 三 一起飙速
One, two, three let's blaze!

3
00:00:07,005 --> 00:00:08,955
那就扣上安全带
So buckle your seat belt

4
00:00:09,025 --> 00:00:10,432
我们要尖叫呐喊
We're gonna scream and yell

5
00:00:10,432 --> 00:00:12,462
飙速会拯救我们
When Blaze goes saving the day

6
00:00:12,462 --> 00:00:13,632
飙速 飙速 飙速
Blaze! Blaze! Blaze!

7
00:00:13,632 --> 00:00:16,384
给我给我给我速度
Gimme, gimme, gimme some speed!

8
00:00:16,384 --> 00:00:18,884
飙速的旋风战车队
Blaze and the Monster Machines

9
00:00:18,884 --> 00:00:19,776
向前冲 飙速
Go, go!  (Blaze!)

10
00:00:19,776 --> 00:00:22,106
飙速的旋风战车队
Blaze and the Monster Machines

11
00:00:22,106 --> 00:00:22,906
向前冲 飙速
Go, go!  (Blaze!)

12
00:00:22,912 --> 00:00:25,402
飙速的旋风战车队
Blaze and the Monster Machines

13
00:00:25,402 --> 00:00:26,982
向前冲 一起飙速
Go, go! Let's Blaze!

14
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,912
伟大动物王冠
The Great Animal Crown!

15
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:42,210
我们溅起来的水花好大哦
Oh man! Our splash was so huge!

16
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:49,656
你们看 是飙速耶
Look! It's Blaze!

17
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:52,700
你好 飙速
Hiya, Blaze!

18
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,640
大家好
Hey everyone!

19
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:57,130
你们看 飙速和我在动物岛
Check it out! Blaze and I are on Animal Island!

20
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:58,306
飙速
Blaze!

21
00:00:58,456 --> 00:00:59,256
你好啊
Hiya, Blaze!

22
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:00,180
大家好
Hey guys!

23
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:06,178
飙速 水很好玩耶
Hey Blaze, the water's great!

24
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:07,600
快来啊
Come on in!

25
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:11,170
对啊 让大家知道我们可以溅出多大的水花吧
Yeah! Let's show them how big a splash we can make!

26
00:01:11,930 --> 00:01:12,600
没问题
Alright!

27
00:01:12,930 --> 00:01:15,460
超 级 水 花
Super Splash!

28
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,576
飙速 你看
Blaze. Look!

29
00:01:22,270 --> 00:01:24,080
瀑布的后面有闪闪发亮的东西耶
There's something shiny behind that waterfall!

30
00:01:25,490 --> 00:01:26,680
我们去看看吧
Let's go check it out.

31
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,860
这是什么啊
What is that?

32
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:37,664
我也不知道 最好拿去给动物们看
I don't know. We better show this to the animals!

33
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:43,764
动物们 看我们找到了什么
Hey animals! Look what we found!

34
00:01:44,970 --> 00:01:45,420
哇
Wow!

35
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:46,540
你看那个
Would you look at that!

36
00:01:48,450 --> 00:01:49,810
好闪亮哦
So shiny!

37
00:01:49,810 --> 00:01:52,420
这个就是伟大动物王冠
This is the Great Animal Crown!

38
00:01:53,060 --> 00:01:54,670
伟大动物王冠
Great Animal Crown?!

39
00:01:55,140 --> 00:01:58,610
这是整个动物王国最特别的王冠了
It's the most special crown in the whole animal kingdom.

40
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,194
不管是谁戴上它 都会是动物岛的国王
Whoever wears it becomes the King of Animal Island!

41
00:02:04,170 --> 00:02:05,530
那是谁该戴它呢
So, who's going to wear it?

42
00:02:05,970 --> 00:02:07,940
对啊 谁会是新的国王呢
Yeah. Who's gonna be the new king?

43
00:02:09,525 --> 00:02:10,380
我不知道耶
I don't know.

44
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,260
国王要很乐于助人
It oughta be someone who's helpful.

45
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:13,380
还要亲切
And kind!

46
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:15,960
他跟岛上的所有动物都是朋友
Someone who's a friend to everyone on the island!

47
00:02:16,340 --> 00:02:18,130
应该是谁呢
Who should it be?

48
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,520
好期待哦
This is exciting!

49
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:20,260
我也不知道
I don't know.

50
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:28,595
没想到居然可以搭潜水艇到动物岛耶
Boy, who knew you could get to Animal Island by submarine!

51
00:02:28,850 --> 00:02:30,570
对啦对啦 可以回家了吗
Yeah, yeah. Can we go home now?

52
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:35,461
回家 可是 克莱瑟 这里是动物岛耶
Go home? But, Crusher - this is Animal Island!

53
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:37,450
有很多东西可以看的
There's so much for us to see!

54
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:42,821
象是 条纹斑马 长鼻子大象 金色王冠
Like: stripy zebras, trunky elephants, a golden crown...

55
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,933
皮克 我又没兴趣看
Pickle, I'm not interested in -

56
00:02:45,340 --> 00:02:47,490
等等 你说金色王冠
Wait. Did you say golden crown?

57
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:51,013
你知道吗 不管是谁戴上那个王冠
You know, I bet the whoever wears that crown -

58
00:02:51,370 --> 00:02:54,140
一定就可以当动物岛的国王
Gets to be the King of Animal Island!

59
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,500
动物岛的国王
King of Animal Island?!

60
00:02:58,180 --> 00:03:01,380
我一直都想当住满动物的岛的国王耶
I've always wanted to be king of an island full of animals.

61
00:03:02,250 --> 00:03:04,280
好具体明确的梦想哦
Such an oddly specific dream.

62
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:08,292
那 我们应该去问问能不能让你当国王
Well, I suppose we should go ask if you can be the king!

63
00:03:08,810 --> 00:03:09,940
不用啦
Nah, that's okay.

64
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,516
我知道一个更容易的方法能当国王
I know a much easier way to become king.

65
00:03:12,930 --> 00:03:15,000
我要把王冠拿走
I'm gonna take the crown!

66
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:20,880
我要拿王冠
Gonna take the crown, gonna take the crown,

67
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:24,340
我要拿王冠 趁没人在看我
gonna take the crown when nobody's looking!

68
00:03:28,295 --> 00:03:29,200
我 拿到了
I... got it!

69
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:31,100
所以哪一个按钮
Now which one of these buttons

70
00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:33,120
可以把王冠放回潜水艇
brings the crown back to the submarine?

71
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:34,250
是这个吗
Is it this one?!

72
00:03:35,970 --> 00:03:37,080
不对 不是这个
No, that's not it.

73
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:38,275
也许是这个按钮
Maybe it's this one.

74
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:42,724
不会吧 一定是其中一个按钮才对
C'mon, it's gotta be one of these buttons!

75
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,950
不要不要不要
Oh no, no no!

76
00:03:53,170 --> 00:03:53,970
不好了
Oh no!

77
00:03:53,970 --> 00:03:55,320
它飞走了
It's flying away!

78
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,330
糟糕
Gaskets!

79
00:03:58,710 --> 00:04:00,920
伟大动物王冠掉进海洋
The great animal crown landed in the ocean!

80
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:03,010
而且沉到海底了
And it's sinking to the bottom!

81
00:04:07,970 --> 00:04:11,170
起码我还有潜水艇可以让我过去拿它
Well, at least I have a submarine to help me go get it!

82
00:04:11,850 --> 00:04:15,138
先走咯 动物们 等我当了国王再见吧
So long, animals! See you when I'm king!

83
00:04:23,330 --> 00:04:26,180
克莱瑟要用潜水艇去拿动物王冠耶
Crusher's using a submarine to try to get the Animal Crown!

84
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:27,106
不会吧
Oh no!

85
00:04:27,610 --> 00:04:29,840
王冠沉到海洋底部了
The crown is at the bottom of the ocean!

86
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,986
如果不想想办法 就会被克莱瑟拿走了
And if we don't do something, Crusher's gonna get it!

87
00:04:33,370 --> 00:04:34,330
真希望有谁
If only there was someone

88
00:04:34,330 --> 00:04:36,186
游得够快 能赢过他
who could swim fast enough to beat him.

89
00:04:36,610 --> 00:04:39,002
别担心 动物们 我做得到
Don't worry, animals. I can do it!

90
00:04:39,470 --> 00:04:40,180
你可以
You can?

91
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:41,290
怎么做
But how?

92
00:04:41,770 --> 00:04:44,410
我只需要来自终极水底动物的
All I need is the super-fast swimming power

93
00:04:44,550 --> 00:04:46,590
超快游泳能力
of the ultimate underwater animal.

94
00:04:47,050 --> 00:04:47,540
没错
Yeah!

95
00:04:47,970 --> 00:04:50,970
要赢过克莱瑟 我们就当 鲨鱼吧
To beat Crusher, let's be... a shark!

96
00:04:53,830 --> 00:04:57,946
来吧 帮我转变成鲨鱼怪兽机器
C'mon! Help turn me into a shark monster machine!

97
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:01,200
首先我需要的是尾鳍
The first thing I need is a tail.

98
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,200
鲨鱼拍动尾鳍时
When a shark moves its tail,

99
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:05,810
会推进鲨鱼往前游动
it pushes the shark forward through the water.

100
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:08,540
要做出尾鳍 就说 尾鳍
To make the tail, say: tail!

101
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,220
尾鳍
Tail!

102
00:05:12,250 --> 00:05:13,880
然后我需要背鳍
Next I need a dorsal fin.

103
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:17,914
背鳍帮助鲨鱼的稳定性 让它可以迅速转身
A dorsal fin keeps a shark steady so it can make fast turns.

104
00:05:18,490 --> 00:05:21,580
要做出背鳍 就说 背鳍
To make the dorsal fin, say: Dorsal Fin!

105
00:05:22,450 --> 00:05:23,620
背鳍
Dorsal Fin!

106
00:05:25,970 --> 00:05:28,986
很好 现在只需要鲨鱼身体了
Great! All I need now is a shark body.

107
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,990
鲨鱼有流线型的身体
Sharks have a stream-lined shape

108
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:33,290
能让它迅速穿过海水
to help cut through the water extra fast.

109
00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:38,168
要做出流线型身体 就说 流线型身体
To make the stream-lined body, say: Streamlined body!

110
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:41,100
流线型身体
Stream-lined body!

111
00:05:43,970 --> 00:05:47,660
我变成了鲨鱼怪兽机器
I'm a Shark Monster Machine!

112
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:56,460
好酷哦
That is cool.

113
00:05:57,370 --> 00:05:58,270
太好了
Alright!

114
00:05:58,940 --> 00:06:02,420
大家别担心 阿杰和我会把王冠拿回来的
Hang on, animals! AJ and I are gonna get that crown back!

115
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:04,970
鲨鱼 力量
Shark... power!

116
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:09,740
赢过他们 鲨鱼飙速
Go get 'em Shark Blaze!

117
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,400
鲨鱼 鲨鱼 鲨鱼
Sharks, sharks, sharks

118
00:06:13,970 --> 00:06:16,200
多么快速的鱼
Oh what a fierce fast fish

119
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:16,790
鲨鱼
Sharks!

120
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:20,220
穿过海水是流线型身体
Streamlined bodies cut through water

121
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:23,280
加速就用力拍动尾鳍
Accelerate when their tails swing harder

122
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:25,680
伪装靠有鳞片的外皮
Camouflaged with a scaly skin

123
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:29,030
三千颗牙 还有大背鳍
3000 teeth and a dorsal fin

124
00:06:30,370 --> 00:06:31,900
鲨鱼 鲨鱼 鲨鱼
Sharks, sharks, sharks

125
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:32,350
鲨鱼
Sharks!

126
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:35,270
多么快速的鱼
Oh what a fierce fast fish

127
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:36,240
呜
Ooh ooh ooh

128
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,040
鲨鱼 鲨鱼 鲨鱼
Sharks, sharks, sharks

129
00:06:38,090 --> 00:06:38,880
加速
Accelerate

130
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:41,170
用灵活的强壮尾鳍
With a strong tail swish

131
00:06:41,170 --> 00:06:42,280
呜
Ooh ooh ooh

132
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,430
多么快速的鱼
Oh what a fierce fast fish yeah

133
00:06:44,690 --> 00:06:45,560
鲨鱼
Sharks!

134
00:06:49,580 --> 00:06:53,160
我要去拿王冠 闪亮黄金王冠
Oh... I'm off to get a crown! A shiny, golden thing!

135
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:56,080
我要放在头上 我就会是国王
I'll put it on my head! And then I will be king!

136
00:06:56,350 --> 00:06:58,740
国王 国王 国王
King-eee, king-eee, King!

137
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:01,990
克莱瑟 你好像很兴奋耶
Gee Crusher. You sound pretty excited!

138
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:03,740
对啊 皮克
I am, Pickle.

139
00:07:04,110 --> 00:07:05,440
真希望有办法可以
I just wish there was some way

140
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:07,460
让潜水艇前进得更快
to make this submarine go faster.

141
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,610
我能让潜水艇前进得更快哦
I can make the submarine go faster!

142
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,520
只要按加速按钮就行了
I just need to push the speed up button!

143
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:16,640
我看看 哪一个才是加速按钮
Now, let's see... Which one's the speed up button?

144
00:07:17,315 --> 00:07:18,590
找到了
Oh! Here it is!

145
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:26,977
哎呀 那是蜡笔按钮
Oops! That was the crayon button.

146
00:07:27,620 --> 00:07:29,290
这个一定是加速按钮
This must be the speed up button.

147
00:07:34,110 --> 00:07:36,650
不对 那是芥末按钮
Nope. That was the mustard button!

148
00:07:37,170 --> 00:07:38,450
这次一定对的
I'll get it this time!

149
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:47,265
哎呀呀 那是小狗玩具按钮
Oopsie. That's the dog toy button!

150
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:51,770
好像是飙速的声音耶
That kinda sounds like Blaze.

151
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:54,440
可是他怎么可以到水底来呢
But how could he get so far underwater?

152
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:57,440
当然
Oh! Duh!

153
00:07:57,610 --> 00:07:59,080
就是变成鲨鱼啊
By turning into a shark!

154
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,060
哈
What?!

155
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:03,560
他想比我先拿到王冠
He's trying to get to the crown before me!

156
00:08:03,975 --> 00:08:05,530
一定要阻止他
Oh, I've got to stop him.

157
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:08,420
我想到了
I've got it!

158
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,300
飙速绝对没办法通过这些
Blaze will never get past these...

159
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:15,070
我的恐怖躲藏机
My... Horrible Hider-Bots!

160
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:22,010
飙速绝对看不到这些家伙的出现
Blaze'll never see these guys coming!

161
00:08:38,710 --> 00:08:40,270
这些东西是从哪里来的
Where did that thing come from?

162
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:43,574
小心 还有一只
Look out! Another one!

163
00:08:46,130 --> 00:08:49,718
糟糕 到处都是恐怖躲藏机耶
Gaskets! This place is full of horrible Hider-Bots!

164
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,420
它们很擅长躲藏耶
They're really good at hiding!

165
00:08:51,770 --> 00:08:52,850
应该怎么避开它们呢
How are we going to get past them?

166
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:55,890
别担心 阿杰
Don't worry, AJ!

167
00:08:56,270 --> 00:08:57,740
在鲨鱼面前 谁都藏不住
Nothing can hide from a shark!

168
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,080
你看
Check it out!

169
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,780
只要有动物在水里移动
Whenever an animal moves in the water

170
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:04,450
就会制造小波浪 称之为振动
they make tiny waves called vibrations.

171
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:08,180
鲨鱼的身体有超级敏锐的感应器
And sharks have super special sensors on their body

172
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:10,200
能感觉这些振动
that can feel those vibrations.

173
00:09:13,130 --> 00:09:15,050
所以就算我们看不到躲藏机
So even if we can't see a Hider-Bot,

174
00:09:15,410 --> 00:09:16,900
也可以从感觉到的振动
we can still figure out where it's hiding

175
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:18,390
知道它藏在哪里
by feeling the vibrations!

176
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,780
来 帮忙用我们的感应器
C'mon! Let's use our sensors

177
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:23,410
避开那些恐怖躲藏机吧
to help us get past those horrible Hider-Bots!

178
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:28,164
等等 我感觉到振动了
Hang on! I'm feeling a vibration!

179
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:30,330
表示有躲藏机
That means there must be a Hider-Bot

180
00:09:30,330 --> 00:09:31,760
就躲在这附近的哪里
hiding somewhere right nearby.

181
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,050
把它找出来吧
Let's look for him!

182
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:36,880
躲藏机躲在哪里呢
Where's the Hider-Bot hiding?

183
00:09:41,070 --> 00:09:41,800
在那里
Right there!

184
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,330
你别跑 恐怖躲藏机
Not so fast, horrible Hider-Bot!

185
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,628
好耶 我们困住它了
Alright! We trapped him!

186
00:09:51,050 --> 00:09:52,940
那架躲藏机抓不到我们了
That Hider-Bot can't get us now!

187
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,070
又有振动了
Another vibration!

188
00:09:58,970 --> 00:10:00,540
躲藏机躲在哪里呢
Where's the Hider-Bot hiding?

189
00:10:04,260 --> 00:10:04,950
在那里
There!

190
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,490
我们又搞定一架了
We got another one!

191
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:16,420
太棒了 只剩下一架恐怖躲藏机了
Alright! There's just one horrible Hider-bot left!

192
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:18,970
它一定就藏在这附近的哪里
And he's gotta be out there somewhere!

193
00:10:20,860 --> 00:10:22,450
我感觉到振动了
I feel the vibrations!

194
00:10:23,610 --> 00:10:25,230
躲藏机躲在哪里呢
Where's the Hider-Bot hiding?

195
00:10:29,530 --> 00:10:30,810
有了 在那里
Yeah, right there!

196
00:10:37,180 --> 00:10:38,780
没有躲藏机了
No more Hider-Bots!

197
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:40,460
什么都挡不住鲨鱼飙速
Nothing stops Shark Blaze!

198
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,240
快走吧
Now, c'mon!

199
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:44,156
我们要赶快在克莱瑟之前拿到王冠
We've gotta hurry and get that crown before Crusher!

200
00:10:44,540 --> 00:10:46,530
鲨鱼 力量
Shark... power!

201
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,960
我等不及要拿到动物王冠了
I can't wait to get that animal crown!

202
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:56,320
我最好快找到加速按钮
And I'd better find that speed-up button

203
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:58,420
才能前进得超级快
so we can get there extra fast!

204
00:10:58,660 --> 00:11:00,500
哦 找到了
And... here it is!

205
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:07,610
那是牙膏按钮
That's the toothpaste button.

206
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:10,530
我其实想按的是 这个按钮
What I meant to push was... this one!

207
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,730
那是臭臭奶酪按钮
That's the stinky cheese button.

208
00:11:16,950 --> 00:11:17,540
等一下哦
Hang on!

209
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,704
好吧 那是枫糖浆按钮
Oh, right. That's the maple syrup button.

210
00:11:29,865 --> 00:11:34,681
你看 克莱瑟 我们后面有一条可爱的小鲨鱼耶
Hey! Look, Crusher! There's a cute little shark behind us!

211
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:37,295
不好了 那是飙速
Oh no! It's Blaze!

212
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,160
鲨鱼飙速真的好快哦
Shark Blaze is really fast.

213
00:11:41,490 --> 00:11:43,330
一定是因为流线型身体
It must be his stream-lined body.

214
00:11:44,130 --> 00:11:47,356
我不能让鲨鱼飙速比我先拿到王冠
I can't let Shark-Blaze get the crown before me!

215
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:50,812
我要想办法挡住这个隧道 他就追不上我们了
I need some way to block this tunnel so he can't follow us.

216
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:53,170
我知道有什么可以挡住隧道
I know what'll block the tunnel.

217
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:58,160
巨大的机器章鱼
A giant Robo-Octopus!

218
00:12:01,730 --> 00:12:02,510
小心啊 飙速
Look out, Blaze!

219
00:12:06,010 --> 00:12:08,690
那只巨大章鱼挡住了整个隧道
That giant octopus is blocking the whole tunnel!

220
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,220
也许我可以把它推开
Maybe I can push him out of the way!

221
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:24,476
糟糕 这只机器章鱼太大了
Lugnuts! This Robo-Octopus is too big.

222
00:12:24,725 --> 00:12:26,175
那我们该怎么移动它呢
Then how are we gonna move it?

223
00:12:27,780 --> 00:12:29,890
它也许大得推不动
It may be too big to push.

224
00:12:30,165 --> 00:12:32,170
可是一定有办法漂浮起来
But nothing is too big to float!

225
00:12:33,250 --> 00:12:36,420
漂浮就是东西浮到水的表面
When something floats, it goes up to the top of the water.

226
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:40,449
所以如果在章鱼身上绑了够多能漂浮的东西
So if we attach enough things that float to the octopus,

227
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:43,110
就能把它拉起来 让路给我们
it'll lift him up and out of our way!

228
00:12:44,170 --> 00:12:44,800
你看
Hey, look!

229
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,873
那艘旧船骸应该有可以漂浮的东西哦
I bet we can find things that float in that old shipwreck.

230
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,800
好 我们去看看吧
C'mon! Let's check it out!

231
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:53,700
看起来这个箱子放了叉子
It looks like this chest has forks inside!

232
00:12:54,230 --> 00:12:56,850
这个箱子有 沙滩球
And this chest has... beach balls!

233
00:12:57,590 --> 00:12:59,994
当我放开它们你认为哪一个会漂浮
When I let go, which do you think will float -

234
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:02,160
叉子 还是沙滩球
the fork, or the beach ball?

235
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:06,010
试试看吧
Let's find out!

236
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:09,852
沙滩球 它在漂浮了
The beach ball! It's floating!

237
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:12,860
沙滩球会漂浮 因为里面都是空气
Beach balls float because they're full of air!

238
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:13,370
快点
Quick!

239
00:13:13,650 --> 00:13:16,444
我们拿出全部的沙滩球绑在章鱼身上吧
Let's get all the beach balls and stick them on the octopus!

240
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:28,900
好耶
Yeah-hea!

241
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:29,750
有用耶
It's working!

242
00:13:30,290 --> 00:13:31,634
章鱼的几根触须
Some of the octopus' arms

243
00:13:31,634 --> 00:13:33,300
已经被往上拉了
are getting pulled to the top of the water!

244
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:36,772
快来 我们去找其他会漂浮的东西
C'mon! Let's go find more things that float!

245
00:13:39,270 --> 00:13:41,060
这个箱子里面都是铁鎚
This chest is full of hammers.

246
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:44,170
这个箱子有 内胎
And this chest has... tire tubes!

247
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:48,140
你认为哪一个会漂浮 铁锤或内胎
Which do you think will float: the hammer or the tube?

248
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,190
我们试试看吧
Let's check and see!

249
00:13:54,660 --> 00:13:56,150
内胎浮起来了
The tube is floating!

250
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,970
虽然它比铁锤还要大
Even though it's bigger than the hammer,

251
00:13:58,230 --> 00:14:00,560
内胎里面的空气 让它可以漂浮
the air inside the tire tube makes it float!

252
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:14,500
你看 章鱼有更多触须浮起来了
Look! More of the octopus' arms are floating!

253
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,890
再一个东西就能让章鱼浮上去了
We just need one more thing to float the octopus away!

254
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,640
我找到一个鼓 和一个煎锅
I found a drum. And... a frying pan.

255
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:26,770
你认为哪一个会漂浮
Which do you think will float?

256
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,000
试试看吧
Let's see!

257
00:14:32,540 --> 00:14:33,620
鼓浮起来了
The drum floats!

258
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:35,910
对啊 它的里面也都是空气
Yeah! It's full of air too!

259
00:14:36,330 --> 00:14:36,970
来吧
C'mon!

260
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:43,720
成功了
We did it!

261
00:14:44,290 --> 00:14:46,160
机器章鱼正在漂浮到水面
The Robo-Octopus is floating away!

262
00:14:46,810 --> 00:14:47,970
现在可以通过隧道了
Now we can get through the tunnel!

263
00:14:48,410 --> 00:14:50,500
我们要赶快去拿到动物王冠
We've gotta hurry and get that animal crown!

264
00:14:51,090 --> 00:14:53,190
鲨鱼 力量
Shark... power!

265
00:15:14,010 --> 00:15:16,452
我们就要拿到王冠了 我就是知道
We're almost at the crown - I just know it!

266
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:17,820
快加速啊 皮克
Speed up, Pickle!

267
00:15:18,490 --> 00:15:19,800
遵命 克莱瑟
Aye aye, Crusher!

268
00:15:22,850 --> 00:15:25,604
哎呀 那是滑溜溜泡泡浴按钮
Whoops! That's the slippery bubble bath button.

269
00:15:26,910 --> 00:15:28,145
应该是这个吧
It's gotta be this one.

270
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:32,360
那个不是加速按钮
That's not the speed-up button,

271
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:34,520
是搔痒羽毛按钮啦
it's the tickling feathers button!

272
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:37,170
如果有贴标签 很快就会找到了
It sure would be easier if these were labelled!

273
00:15:42,300 --> 00:15:43,130
我看到它了
There it is!

274
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:45,230
伟大动物王冠
The Great Animal Crown!

275
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,520
我只要拿到它就行了
All I've gotta do now is grab it,

276
00:15:48,730 --> 00:15:50,470
然后王冠就会属于我
and then the crown will be mine!

277
00:15:50,810 --> 00:15:51,960
完全属于我
All mine!!

278
00:15:55,930 --> 00:15:57,412
不好了 飙速 你看
Oh no, Blaze! Look!

279
00:15:58,260 --> 00:16:00,795
克莱瑟的潜水艇就快拿到动物王冠了
Crusher's submarine is almost at the animal crown!

280
00:16:01,230 --> 00:16:03,040
我们要比他先过去拿到王冠
We've gotta get there before he takes it!

281
00:16:03,610 --> 00:16:06,330
我们需要 鲨鱼飙风速度
We need: Shark Blazing Speed!

282
00:16:11,930 --> 00:16:16,564
要给我飙风速度 就说 一起飙速
To give me Blazing Speed say 'Let's Blaze!'

283
00:16:17,190 --> 00:16:19,550
一起 飙速
Let's Blaze!

284
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:31,510
就快 拿到了
Almost... Got it!

285
00:16:34,650 --> 00:16:35,860
交过来 克莱瑟
Hand it over, Crusher!

286
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,820
这个王冠不属于你
That crown doesn't belong to you!

287
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:41,020
是鲨鱼飙速耶
It's Shark Blaze!

288
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,100
不对不对
Oh no.

289
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:45,200
你阻止不了我当动物岛的国王的
You're not gonna stop me from being king of Animal Island!

290
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,800
这个王冠属于我
That crown is mine!

291
00:16:54,450 --> 00:16:56,660
克莱瑟的潜水艇拉得很用力耶
Crusher's submarine is pulling really hard!

292
00:16:57,160 --> 00:17:00,722
要拿到王冠 我的拉力一定要比潜水艇还大
To get the crown, I've got to pull harder than that submarine!

293
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:03,660
我们来看 谁的拉力比较大
Let's figure out who's pulling with the most force!

294
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:05,520
转换成遮光板视野
Switching to visor view!

295
00:17:07,890 --> 00:17:09,740
飙速的拉力现在是8
Blaze is pulling with a force of 8.

296
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:12,760
克莱瑟的潜水艇是6
And Crusher's submarine is at 6.

297
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:16,540
哪个数字比较大 8或6
Which number's bigger - 8 or 6?

298
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:21,842
是8 飙速的拉力比较大
8! Blaze is pulling with more force!

299
00:17:23,250 --> 00:17:24,310
克莱瑟
Wow, Crusher!

300
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:27,730
飙速的拉力比你的潜水艇还大耶
Blaze is pulling even harder than your submarine!

301
00:17:28,290 --> 00:17:29,690
很快就不是这样了
Not for long, he's not!

302
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,842
克莱瑟的潜水艇现在的拉力是10
Now Crusher's submarine is pulling with a force of 10!

303
00:17:38,250 --> 00:17:40,930
哪个数字比较大 8或10
Which number is bigger - 8 or 10?

304
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:44,060
是10
10!

305
00:17:44,770 --> 00:17:48,146
不好了 克莱瑟的潜水艇拉力比飙速还大
Oh no! Crusher's submarine is pulling harder than Blaze!

306
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:54,290
飙速加油 你做得到 我知道你可以的
C'mon, Blaze! You can do it! I know you can!

307
00:17:55,330 --> 00:17:57,800
鲨鱼 力量
Shark... power!

308
00:17:59,425 --> 00:18:02,120
你看 飙速的拉力增加到14
Look! Blaze's force went up to 14!!

309
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:05,420
哪个数字比较大 14或10
Which number is bigger: 14 or 10?

310
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:12,210
14 对了 现在飙速的拉力最大
14! Yeah! Now Blaze is pulling the hardest!

311
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:18,430
太好了
Alright!

312
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,850
我们拿到王冠了
We got the crown!

313
00:18:24,455 --> 00:18:26,418
不知道克莱瑟和他的潜水艇去哪里了
I wonder where Crusher and his submarine ended up.

314
00:18:33,260 --> 00:18:34,880
我以为情况还会更糟呢
That could have been a lot worse.

315
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:37,120
糗了
Uh oh.

316
00:18:46,410 --> 00:18:48,492
真好玩 可以再来一次吗
Fun! Can we do that again?!

317
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,740
你们看 是飙速耶
Look! It's Blaze!

318
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:06,730
他把伟大动物王冠带回来了
And he brought back the Great Animal Crown!

319
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,392
做得好 飙速和阿杰
Way to go Blaze and AJ!

320
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:11,320
我们就知道你们办得到
We knew you two could do it!

321
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:13,130
现在王冠拿回来了
And now that the crown is back,

322
00:19:13,450 --> 00:19:15,400
你们终于可以选出国王了
you can finally choose your King!

323
00:19:16,060 --> 00:19:17,900
动物岛的动物们
Animals of Animal Island,

324
00:19:18,450 --> 00:19:20,930
我们该选谁当我们的新国王呢
who should we choose to be our new king?

325
00:19:22,020 --> 00:19:24,600
他应该要乐于助人
Well, it's gotta be someone really helpful.

326
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:26,020
还要亲切
And kind!

327
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:29,310
他跟岛上的所有动物都是朋友
Someone who's a friend to everyone on the island!

328
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,060
那就决定了
Then it's decided!

329
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:36,784
我们选择当动物岛国王的怪兽机器就是
The monster machine we choose to be King of Animal Island is...

330
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:39,690
飙速
Blaze!

331
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:43,312
我 好意外哦
Me? Wow! I can't believe it!

332
00:19:48,070 --> 00:19:48,830
太棒了
Alright!

333
00:19:50,670 --> 00:19:53,340
我是动物岛的国王
I'm king of Animal Island!

334
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:06,680
不公平啦 皮克
It's not fair, Pickle.

335
00:20:07,060 --> 00:20:08,940
我差一点就是国王了
I almost got to be King.

336
00:20:09,470 --> 00:20:11,410
现在我什么都不是了
But now I don't get to be anything!

337
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:13,680
往好的一面看嘛
Well, look on the bright side.

338
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:17,104
你现在可以开着很酷的潜水艇回家耶
At least you get to drive home in this cool submarine.

339
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:21,630
所以那个加速按钮在哪里
Now, where is that speed up button?

340
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:24,435
不要 不要再按钮了 不要
Oh, no. No more buttons. No more.

341
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:25,290
找到了
Found it!

342
00:20:37,810 --> 00:20:40,400
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines!

343
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:43,024
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines!

344
00:20:43,024 --> 00:20:44,432
系上了安全带
Buckle up gonna roll

345
00:20:44,432 --> 00:20:45,850
准备好要出发
Yeah, we're ready to go

346
00:20:45,850 --> 00:20:48,325
有飙速就有惊喜
With Blaze You'll be amazed

347
00:20:48,705 --> 00:20:51,269
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines

348
00:20:51,380 --> 00:20:54,100
极速 冒险不断前进
It's time for adventure extreme

349
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:55,345
全力加速冲刺
Gonna kick it in gear

350
00:20:55,345 --> 00:20:56,645
享受完美速度
We'll be catching some air

351
00:20:56,645 --> 00:20:59,877
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines

352
00:21:00,042 --> 00:21:02,981
飙速 以及怪兽赛车
It's Blaze and the Monster Machines

